      "dcterms:title": "Introduction to Left-Right Symmetric Models",
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20140308",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We motivate left-right symmetric models by the possibility of spontaneous parity breaking. Th,;n we describe the multiplets and the La.grangian of such models. Finally we discuss lower bounds on the right-handed scale. *) Lectc:re given at.the 4th Hellenic School on Elementary Particle Physics, Corfu, 2- 20 September 1992.",
